| **Feature**         | **C++**                              | **Java**                                      | **Python**                      |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| **Import**          | `#include <list>`                    | `import java.util.LinkedList;`                | `from collections import deque` |
| **Declaration**     | `list<int> l;`                       | `LinkedList<Integer> l = new LinkedList<>();` | `l = deque()`                   |
| **Add Front**       | `push_front(x)` / `emplace_front(x)` | `addFirst(x)`                                 | `appendleft(x)`                 |
| **Add Back**        | `push_back(x)` / `emplace_back(x)`   | `addLast(x)`                                  | `append(x)`                     |
| **Remove Front**    | `pop_front()`                        | `removeFirst()`                               | `popleft()`                     |
| **Remove Back**     | `pop_back()`                         | `removeLast()`                                | `pop()`                         |
| **View Front**      | `front()`                            | `getFirst()`                                  | `l[0]`                          |
| **View Back**       | `back()`                             | `getLast()`                                   | `l[-1]`                         |
| **Access by Index** | ❌ O(n)                               | ❌ O(n)                                        | ❌ O(n)                          |
| **Insert Middle**   | ✅ O(1) *(with iterator)*             | ✅ O(1) *(with iterator)*                      | ❌ O(n)                          |
| **Size**            | `size()`                             | `size()`                                      | `len(l)`                        |
| **Empty Check**     | `empty()`                            | `isEmpty()`                                   | `if not l:`                     |
| **Clear**           | `clear()`                            | `clear()`                                     | `clear()`                       |
| **Remove Element**  | `remove(x)`                          | `removeFirstOccurrence(x)`                    | `remove(x)`                     |


